      "source": [
        "# Key\n",
        "\n",
        "A key identifies an entry in a mapping such as a dictionary. Dictionary keys must be hashable; for example, `\"name\"` is the key in `{\"name\": \"Ada\"}`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-key)"
      ]
    }
